WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.010
"Look!" Joe pointed to the floor.

2
00:00:08.011 --> 00:00:12.869
"Our Classroom Rules poster!"

3
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.513
Miss Shin picked up the poster.

4
00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:26.469
Dirty footprints covered all the rules.

5
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.930
"Yay!" Teddy shouted. "No more rules!"

6
00:00:30.931 --> 00:00:34.777
Miss Shin frowned.

7
00:00:34.778 --> 00:00:43.348
She put the dirty poster in the trash.

8
00:00:43.349 --> 00:00:46.883
"Time for a class meeting," she said.

9
00:00:46.884 --> 00:00:49.670
Everyone gathered around the teacher.

10
00:00:49.671 --> 00:00:52.331
"What do you think?" she asked.

11
00:00:52.332 --> 00:00:58.596
"Do we need to make rules again?"

12
00:00:58.597 --> 00:01:01.058
"No!" Teddy yelled.

13
00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:04.147
Morgan covered her ears.

14
00:01:04.148 --> 00:01:07.548
Then she raised her hand.

15
00:01:07.549 --> 00:01:11.874
"Yes," said Morgan. "We need rules.

16
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:21.902
Without rules, the classroom may be too noisy."

17
00:01:21.903 --> 00:01:24.844
Jamal raised his hand next.

18
00:01:24.845 --> 00:01:30.165
"Without rules, kids may forget their manners," he said.

19
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:33.989
Sadie saw Teddy poking Jamal with a ruler.

20
00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:36.004
She raised her hand.

21
00:01:36.005 --> 00:01:40.630
"Kids may not respect others."

22
00:01:40.631 --> 00:01:45.064
"Hmm," said Miss Shin. "Let's see.

23
00:01:45.065 --> 00:01:47.808
Who thinks we need rules?"

24
00:01:47.809 --> 00:01:50.250
Ten hands went up.

25
00:01:50.251 --> 00:01:54.250
But Teddy's hands stayed down.

26
00:01:54.251 --> 00:01:59.811
"Ugh," Teddy groaned. "I lose."

27
00:01:59.812 --> 00:02:03.597
"Everyone wins, Teddy," said Miss Shin.

28
00:02:03.598 --> 00:02:07.043
"Classroom rules help us learn and have fun.

29
00:02:07.044 --> 00:02:14.961
Let's begin."

